Z||000000||AL||03-15-2001||11:29 PM||||<BR>it all started cause my neighbor didn't believe that i beat v6 mustangs,then he said you won't beat this mustang, i said maybe not but i'm game.well we lined them up,i hit the gas and i beat him, not buy much but i did,then we lined up again and i was taking him again but this time at the end he got me,but buy half a car,after that i decided no more,i didn't want to force my car anymore but at least he saw that this fiero is no push over,now i'm thinking turbo,if only i can find one,well that's my story.<B>AL</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif">   <BR>86gt ported and polished heads,flowmaster 80 series exhaust,ported manifolds, decklid scoop holley air scoop, k&n air filter,rear swaybar.<BR>84indy<p>[This message has been edited by AL (edited 03-16-2001).]||||reg||14
